Cell["\<\
Cyclotron Frequency (HZ) for species \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]i\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].  (MKS: B is in Tesla)\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9009657243362007`*^9, 3.9009657511465473`*^9}, {
